點的把蝦醬也直接配著麵吃乾抹淨了😅\n\n實在非常喜歡，\n當天只是路過抱持著簡單吃個午餐的心態，\n但這種價位那吃到這樣的品質，\n實在非常超值，\n有時間一定會特地再去拜訪，\n當天吃完就已念念不忘！",null,[0,70]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11227828546023699830/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFXZUdGcVZrbGxSR1J4VTIxMFFrNXNjRTVhUkZKbVlsaFdNR05JWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,6180,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WeGFqVkllRGRxU210Qk5scE5aRFJmYlhWMGNIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe97b5718cb4cbd23!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmVxajVIeDdqSmtBNlpNZDRfbXV0cHc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WeGFqVkllRGRxU210Qk5scE5aRFJmYlhWMGNIYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WeGFqVkllRGRxU210Qk5scE5aRFJmYlhWMGNIYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WeGFqVkllRGRxU210Qk5scE5aRFJmYlhWMGNIYxILMGRPQ2FLUE1udFkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tVnhhalZJZURkcVNtdEJObHBOWkRSZmJYVjBjSGMSCzBkT0NhS1BNbnRZIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARI71MyxhXe-kqCzBkT0NhS1BNb